{
  "voice": "Microsoft David Desktop",
  "tail": 26.2,
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "This is sickle seagrass, Thalassia hemprichii.",
      "start": 0.22,
      "end": 2.597,
      "wav": "C:\\Users\\reaga\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\th_hemprichii_speech\\line_0.wav",
      "show_end": 3.093
    },
    {
      "text": "A display, not a scan of a meadow in Mati.",
      "start": 3.093,
      "end": 5.322,
      "wav": "C:\\Users\\reaga\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\th_hemprichii_speech\\line_1.wav",
      "show_end": 5.858
    },
    {
      "text": "The leaves are curved ribbons, not straight straps.",
      "start": 5.858,
      "end": 9.077,
      "wav": "C:\\Users\\reaga\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\th_hemprichii_speech\\line_2.wav",
      "show_end": 10.65
    },
    {
      "text": "In the blade you can see short black bars.",
      "start": 10.65,
      "end": 13.97,
      "wav": "C:\\Users\\reaga\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\th_hemprichii_speech\\line_3.wav",
      "show_end": 14.407
    },
    {
      "text": "Those are tannin cells.",
      "start": 14.407,
      "end": 15.799,
      "wav": "C:\\Users\\reaga\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\th_hemprichii_speech\\line_4.wav",
      "show_end": 16.295
    },
    {
      "text": "The rhizome is thick, with scars between the shoots.",
      "start": 16.295,
      "end": 18.826,
      "wav": "C:\\Users\\reaga\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\th_hemprichii_speech\\line_5.wav",
      "show_end": 19.282
    },
    {
      "text": "The patch spreads when that buried stem grows and sends up new shoots.",
      "start": 19.282,
      "end": 22.098,
      "wav": "C:\\Users\\reaga\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\th_hemprichii_speech\\line_6.wav",
      "show_end": 22.514
    },
    {
      "text": "Roots grow down at the nodes.",
      "start": 22.514,
      "end": 24.02,
      "wav": "C:\\Users\\reaga\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\th_hemprichii_speech\\line_7.wav",
      "show_end": 24.416
    },
    {
      "text": "It can also flower and set seed.",
      "start": 24.416,
      "end": 26.2,
      "wav": "C:\\Users\\reaga\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\th_hemprichii_speech\\line_8.wav",
      "show_end": 26.65
    }
  ],
  "srt": "C:\\Users\\reaga\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\th_hemprichii_speech\\captions.srt"
}